// A rule that reads another derived type through `Not`, `Forall`, or an aggregate is evaluated after that type is complete, whatever the types are named (D6).
Fact x Identified by Int
Fact y Identified by Int Derived from (Foreach x: y(x))
Bool aa Holds when (Sum(Foreach y: y) < 4)
Bool zz Holds when (Sum(Foreach y: y) < 4).
+x(0). +x(1). +x(2).
?aa(). ?zz().
+x(3).
?!aa(). ?!zz().
